l; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">06/04/23</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Taller dirigido a la comunidad, a cargo de la Dra. Mendez, vinculado al tema:&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">&ldquo;Llanto y sue&ntilde;o del lactante. &iquest;Que esperar?&rdquo;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">21/04/23</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Encuentro final y de cierre de actividades</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Si bien en cada encuentro habr&aacute; una de las profesionales a cargo, en el mismo acompa&ntilde;ar&aacute;n otras integrantes del equipo, incluidas las estudiantes. Asimismo, estas &uacute;ltimas ser&aacute;n las encargadas de llevar a cabo las tareas de preparaci&oacute;n y producci&oacute;n de folleter&iacute;a, material impreso de f&aacute;cil lectura, banners, y registro de datos.</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-96ed1eab-7fff-e97e-3f04-881fcc0bcca7\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Por otro lado, la asesor&iacute;a en lactancia podr&aacute; llevarse a cabo tanto en el caps, como tambi&eacute;n (en los casos que se requiera) en los domicilios de las mam&aacute;s pu&eacute;rperas.</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n</div>', 0);
INSERT INTO `peis-cronograma` (`id`, `cronograma`, `idProyecto`) VALUES
(53, '<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-ansi-language: ES-MX;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">A.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: ES-MX;\">Taller te&oacute;rico pr&aacute;ctico, que incluye salida a campo en el entorno de la Escuela, para reconocer, cuantificar las especies vegetales y aprendizaje de t&eacute;cnicas para cultivar algunas especies nativas como los algarrobos. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-ansi-language: ES-MX;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">B.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: ES-MX;\">Taller te&oacute;rico pr&aacute;ctico para identificar caracter&iacute;sticas beneficiosas de las plantas, as&iacute; como algunos problemas que pueden causar.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-ansi-language: ES-MX;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">C.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: ES-MX;\">Desarrollar competencias en: </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left: 72.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: ES-MX;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: ES-MX;\">Lengua y literatura, a trav&eacute;s de la lectura de textos relacionados con la tem&aacute;tica, por ejemplo &ldquo;El Algarrobo Abuelo&rdquo;.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left: 72.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: ES-MX;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: ES-MX;\">Matem&aacute;ticas, a trav&eacute;s de actividades como: el c&aacute;lculo de la densidad de &aacute;rboles en el entorno y el registro de per&iacute;metro, altura y volumen arb&oacute;reo.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left: 72.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: ES-MX;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: ES-MX;\">Otras Ciencias Naturales, a trav&eacute;s de actividades como, la observaci&oacute;n y el registro de las caracter&iacute;sticas del suelo en zonas vegetadas y no vegetadas.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left: 72.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: ES-MX;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: ES-MX;\">Formaci&oacute;n &Eacute;tica y Ciudadana, a trav&eacute;s del fomento de la valoraci&oacute;n y el cuidado de la vegetaci&oacute;n.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left: 72.0pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: ES-MX;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: ES-MX;\">Educaci&oacute;n Tecnol&oacute;gica, a trav&eacute;s de la utilizaci&oacute;n de aplicaciones para celular, como por ejemplo ForestTools o Trees.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-ansi-language: ES-MX;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">D.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: ES-MX;\">Socializaci&oacute;n de las opiniones y percepciones de integrantes y actores del proyecto.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-ansi-language: ES-MX;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">E.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: ES-MX;\">Elaboraci&oacute;n de material de difusi&oacute;n (cartillas, material audio visual, poster, etc.)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-ansi-language: ES-MX;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">F.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: ES-MX;\">Presentaci&oacute;n de los resultados en congresos de extensi&oacute;n.</span></p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-layout-alt: fixed; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-table-lspace: 7.05pt; margin-left: 4.8pt; mso-table-rspace: 7.05pt; margin-right: 4.8pt; mso-table-anchor-vertical: paragraph; mso-table-anchor-horizontal: margin; mso-table-left: -21.6pt; mso-table-top: -2.4pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"1\" width=\"642\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"left\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; height: 13.3pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 56.45pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 13.3pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"75\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"