e;n de se&ntilde;as in&eacute;ditas del &aacute;mbito de la Biolog&iacute;a de modo escrito y gestual (a trav&eacute;s de videos).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Sistematizaci&oacute;n de se&ntilde;as de Biolog&iacute;a. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Dibujo de la mayor cantidad de se&ntilde;as posibles (esta actividad requiere m&aacute;s tiempo). </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Recopilaci&oacute;n del concepto central de cada se&ntilde;a vinculado a la disciplina.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Divulgaci&oacute;n de los avances en congresos de educaci&oacute;n, discapacidad, extensi&oacute;n, etc. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Segundo a&ntilde;o: 1&deg; trimestre <br /></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Actividades a realizar:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Reuniones semanales del grupo extensionista para la revisi&oacute;n de la sistematizaci&oacute;n de las se&ntilde;as realizada y correcci&oacute;n de posibles errores. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Recopilaci&oacute;n de los dibujos de se&ntilde;as para incluir en el manuscrito junto a su sistematizaci&oacute;n. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Dictado de cursos y talleres a docentes, int&eacute;rpretes, estudiantes sordos y a la comunidad sorda en general para poner en conocimiento, uso y difusi&oacute;n las se&ntilde;as in&eacute;ditas sistematizadas por este proyecto. En estos talleres participar&aacute; todo el equipo de extensi&oacute;n. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Revisi&oacute;n del manuscrito, elecci&oacute;n de dise&ntilde;os y formatos de &eacute;ste. El material producido deber&aacute; contar con la se&ntilde;a de uso en Biolog&iacute;a, la descripci&oacute;n del concepto, la sistematizaci&oacute;n correspondiente y el dibujo esquem&aacute;tico que oriente al lector. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Expectativas de logro:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Revisi&oacute;n de las sistematizaciones realizadas y correcci&oacute;n de posibles errores por todos los miembros del equipo. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Revisi&oacute;n de los dibujos y su concordancia con la sistematizaci&oacute;n realizada para detectar posibles errores o incongruencias.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Concreci&oacute;n del dictado de cursos y talleres.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Segundo a&ntilde;o: 2&deg; trimestre <br /></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Actividades a realizar:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Reuniones semanales del grupo extensionista para la revisi&oacute;n de la sistematizaci&oacute;n de las se&ntilde;as realizada y correcci&oacute;n de posibles errores. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Time