en Buenos Aires.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Expectativas de logro:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Ultimar detalles de la sistematizaci&oacute;n dibujos, descripci&oacute;n y est&eacute;tica del manuscrito.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Conclusi&oacute;n de los dibujos y revisi&oacute;n de &eacute;stos por todos los integrantes del equipo de extensi&oacute;n. Discusi&oacute;n.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Segundo a&ntilde;o: 4&deg; trimestre <br /></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Actividades a realizar:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Reuniones semanales del grupo extensionista para la revisi&oacute;n de la sistematizaci&oacute;n de las se&ntilde;as realizada y correcci&oacute;n de posibles errores. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Recopilaci&oacute;n de los dibujos de se&ntilde;as para incluir en el manuscrito junto a su sistematizaci&oacute;n. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Revisi&oacute;n final del manuscrito completo, elecci&oacute;n de dise&ntilde;os y formatos de &eacute;ste. El material producido deber&aacute; contar con la se&ntilde;a de uso en Biolog&iacute;a, la descripci&oacute;n del concepto, la sistematizaci&oacute;n correspondiente y el dibujo esquem&aacute;tico que oriente al lector. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Verificaci&oacute;n del formato de los manuscritos generados en San Luis y en Buenos Aires.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Presentaciones a congresos de avances realizados.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Expectativas de logro:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Ultimar detalles de la sistematizaci&oacute;n dibujos, descripci&oacute;n y est&eacute;tica del manuscrito.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Conclusi&oacute;n de los dibujos y revisi&oacute;n de &eacute;stos por todos los integrantes del equipo de extensi&oacute;n. Discusi&oacute;n.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Env&iacute;o del manuscrito a editorial para posterior publicaci&oacute;n y difusi&oacute;n.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Divulgaci&oacute;n de los avances en congresos de educaci&oacute;n, discapacidad, extensi&oacute;n, etc. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\"><strong>Aclaraci&oacute;n:</strong> durante el periodo de desarrollo de este proyecto los miembros de los equipos de San Luis y Buenos Aires, se comunicar&aacute;n virtualmente cada 1 mes aproximadamente, de acuerdo con las necesidades que surjan. En dichas reuniones, acordar&aacute;n todo aquello concerniente a las actividades y a las expectativas de logro deseadas. </span></p>', 0);
INSERT INTO `peis-cronograma` (`id`, `cronograma`, `idProyecto`) VALUES
(143, '<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-b517b455-7fff-0cea-66e4-eadbaaa5fdc8\"></span></p>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 0pt;\" align=\"left\">\r\n<table style=\"border: none; border-collapse: collapse;\"><colgroup><col width=\"130\" /><col width=\"58\" /><col width=\"58\" /><col width=\"52\" /><col width=\"57\" /><col width=\"50\" /><col width=\"57\" /><col width=\"48\" /><col width=\"57\" /></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 1pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\" rowspan=\"3\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Actividad</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\" colspan=\"8\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">meses</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.5pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\" rowspan=\"2\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Abril</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\" rowspan=\"2\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Mayo</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\" rowspan=\"2\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">junio</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\" rowspan=\"2\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">julio</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\" rowspan=\"2\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri,sans-serif; colo