 solid #000000 1pt;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">0.- Puesta en condiciones de los tableros y compra de los materiales que sean necesarios para dejarlos funcionando en un 100x100.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; background-color: #00b050; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; background-color: #00b050; padding: 0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 118.95pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">1.- Elevaci&oacute;n de las propuestas a escuelas secundarias en donde su orientaci&oacute;n est&aacute; relacionada con el curso propuesto.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; background-color: #00b050; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 90.7pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">2.- Recepci&oacute;n de las inscripciones.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; background-color: #00b050; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 90.7pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 2pt 0pt 2pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal