 /></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Realizaci&oacute;n de jornadas de capacitaci&oacute;n sobre la instalaci&oacute;n y el funcionamiento del biodigestor con los alumnos con la colaboraci&oacute;n de los docentes&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">15 y 16&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Instituto Nuestra Se&ntilde;ora del Carmen&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">- Instituto&nbsp; Sagrado Coraz&oacute;n&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Relevamiento por parte de los alumnos del volumen de residuos solidos generados en el establecimiento para uso como materia prima del biodigestor.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">18 y 19&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Instituto Nuestra Se&ntilde;ora del Carmen&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">- Instituto&nbsp; Sagrado Coraz&oacute;n&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Visitas de los alumnos de las Instituciones Educativas al laboratorio del Proyecto de investigaci&oacute;n P 144618 &ldquo;Estudio de procesos catal&iacute;ticos para la obtenci&oacute;n de hidrogeno y gas de s&iacute;ntesis&rdquo; de la FICA para observar la producci&oacute;n de hidrogeno a partir del biocombustible (metano) obtenido en el biodigestor.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">22 y 23&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">FICA-UNSL</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-8dfd38b3-7fff-b95f-3ef3-8f8e3c6e532c\"></span></p>', 0),
(152, '<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Mes 1 y 2&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Taller<span style=\"color: #2a2a2a; font-family: Times New Roman;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">1: </span></span><span style=\"color: #282525; background-color: #ffffff; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Influencia de los medios masivos de comunicaci&oacute;n e impacto en las conductas y comportamientos de los j&oacute;venes.</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #282525; background-color: #ffffff; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Mes 3</span></span></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #2a2a2a; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Taller N&ordm;2:&nbsp; Desorden alimentario.</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #2a2a2a; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Mes 4</span></span></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #2a2a2a; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Taller N&ordm;3: Prevenci&oacute;n del Acoso Escolar.</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #2a2a2a; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Mes 5</span></span></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #2a2a2a; background-color: #ffffff; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Taller N&ordm;4:</span><span style=\"color: #282525; background-color: #ffffff; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> </span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #282525; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Consumo indebido de drogas. Uso de plantas medicinales y aquellas con efectos t&oacute;xicos.</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #282525; background-color: #ffffff; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Mes 6 y 7</span></span></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #282525; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Taller N&ordm;5: </span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #282525; background-color: #ffffff; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Protocolos de actuaci&oacute;n y prevenci&oacute;n de accidentes. </span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #282525; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Mes 8. </span></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #282525; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Encuentro Final.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #282525; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Mes 9 y Mes 10.</span></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #282525; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap;\">An&aacute;lisis de los encuentros</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #282525; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Mes 11 y 12</span></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #282525; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Formulaci&oacute;n del Informe Final.</span></strong></p>', 0),
(153, '<p>Se realizar&aacute;n en el mes de marzo visitas a las tres escuelas para coordinar con directivos y docentes las actividades relacionadas con el proyecto. Se planea comenzar en el transcurso del mes de abril con las actividades propias del proyecto; el equipo extensionista viajar&aacute;, al menos, una vez por mes a los establecimientos escolares para desarrollar las actividades y en una &uacute;ltima visita planteada para octubre/noviembre (seg&uacute;n disponibilidad de la escuela), finalizaremos el proyecto con la realizaci&oacute;n de distintas actividades que nos permitir&aacute;n efectuar un an&aacute;lisis de lo aprendido por los ni&ntilde;os en la tematica.</p>', 0);
INSERT INTO `peis-cronograma` (`id`, `cronograma`, `idProyecto`) VALUES
(154, '<p id=\"docs-internal-guid-fc5df41f-7fff-16ef-5615-8fb7fb0b191b\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0.0pt; margin-bottom: 0.0pt;\"></p>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: -5.5pt;\" align=\"left\">\r\n<table style=\"border: none;\"><colgroup><col width=\"201.0\" /><col width=\"201.0\" /><col width=\"201.0\" /></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 0.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1.0pt;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0.0pt; margin-bottom: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Actividades</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1.0pt;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0.0pt; margin-bottom: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Mes</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1.0pt;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0.0pt; margin-bottom: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Lugar y destinatarios</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 0.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1.0pt;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0.0pt; margin-bottom: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Respecto al Objetivo 1</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">1 </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Organizaci&oacute;n y asistencia a reuniones para la coordinaci&oacute;n, acuerdos y toma de decisiones para ubicaci&oacute;n del Archivo en dependencias de la UNSL.</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0.0pt; margin-bottom: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">2 Compra de art&iacute;culos de librer&iacute;a para la conservaci&oacute;n y organizaci&oacute;n del Archivo</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0.0pt; margin-bottom: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">3 Reuniones para reorganizar y catalogar el material del Archivo.</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0.0pt; margin-bottom: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">4 Articulaci&oacute;n con asignaturas para realizaci&oacute;n de cat&aacute;logo del Archivo en el marco de Pr&aacute;cticas Profesionales</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1.0pt;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0.0pt; margin-bottom: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">1 </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Marzo</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0.0pt; margin-bottom: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">2 Marzo</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0.0pt; margin-bottom: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">3 Marzo-Diciembre</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0.0pt; margin-bottom: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">4 Agosto-diciembre</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1.0pt;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0.0pt; margin-bottom: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Lugar:</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0.0pt; margin-bottom: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Dependencias de la UNSL</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0.0pt; margin-bottom: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Destinatarios:</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0.0pt; margin-bottom: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Integrantes Archivo del Orgullo de San Luis</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 0.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1.0pt;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0.0pt; margin-bottom: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Respecto al Objetivo 2</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0.0pt; margin-bottom: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">1 Participaci&oacute;n del equipo en jornadas de trabajo para la&nbsp; elaboraci&oacute;n de mapeos sobre tem&aacute;ticas, fuentes a recopilar.</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0.0pt; margin-bottom: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">2 Visita y trabajo documental en Archivos locales: Archivo UNSL, Archivo del Diario de la Rep&uacute;blica</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0.0pt; margin-bottom: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">3 Contactar personas pertenecientes a la comunidad LGBTTTIQANB+ de San Luis para la realizaci&oacute;n de entrevistas</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0.0pt; margin-bottom: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">4 Jornadas de trabajo en relaci&oacute;n para sistematizaci&oacute;n de la experiencia y co-construcci&oacute;n de conocimiento</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt 5.0pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1.0pt;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0.0pt; margin-bottom: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">1 Abril</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0.0pt; margin-bottom: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">2, 3 y 4 mayo-agosto</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"verti