 \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES-MX;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES-MX;\">-Movimiento Feriante consolidado en un 80% al cabo de un a&ntilde;o de iniciado el proyecto.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.1pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES-MX;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES-MX;\">Encuesta, estudio, informe.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ES-MX;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-fami