: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Actividad de reflexi&oacute;n/discusi&oacute;n grupal en relaci&oacute;n a la actividad de investigaci&oacute;n/intervenci&oacute;n en las escuelas</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Implicancias de lo trabajado para el dise&ntilde;o del proyecto pedag&oacute;gico.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5pt; vertical-align: top; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1pt solid #000000;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">FREIRE, Paulo (1986) La importancia de leer y el proceso de liberaci&oacute;n. Siglo XXI editores.</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; f