t:\"\";\r\n	mso-padding-alt:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n	mso-para-margin-top:0cm;\r\n	mso-para-margin-right:0cm;\r\n	mso-para-margin-bottom:10.0pt;\r\n	mso-para-margin-left:0cm;\r\n	line-height:115%;\r\n	mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\r\n	font-size:11.0pt;\r\n	font-family:\"Calibri\",sans-serif;\r\n	mso-ansi-language:ES;}\r\n</style>\r\n<![endif]--></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 2.0pt 0cm 2.0pt 0cm;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Relacionar conceptos te&oacute;ricos con la propuesta del establecimiento Bello Estar y que los estudiantes sean capaces de crear propuestas novedosas.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 2.0pt 0cm 2.0pt 0cm;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Poder interactuar con un actor social que realice pr&aacute;cticas eco sustentables relacionadas con el turismo, a fin de ampliar los nuevos horizontes en sus carreras profesionales<span style=\"color: black;\">.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 2.0pt 0cm 2.0pt 0cm;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Lograr que los estudiantes trabajen en la recolecci&oacute;n de datos mediante encuestas dise&ntilde;adas por ellos mismos.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 2.0pt 0cm 2.0pt 0cm;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: black; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Que los estudiantes puedan aplicar conocimientos y herramientas </span><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">del idioma portugu&eacute;s<span style=\"color: black;\"> en la </span>actualizaci&oacute;n del contenido de la p&aacute;gina WEB del establecimiento.</span></p>', '<p><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">El proyecto se llevar&aacute; a cabo en Loma Bola, Traslasierra C&oacute;rdoba, a 15 km de la Villa de Merlo (Zona de influencia de la FTU-UNSL y lugar de residencia de muchos estudiantes de las carreras de turismo y hoteler&iacute;a).</span></p>', '<p><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: ES; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">La propuesta se dirige de manera directa al establecimiento hotelero familiar Bello Estar y de manera indirecta a sus potenciales clientes.&nbsp;</span></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Actividades de campo con el prop&oacute;sito de observar y registrar de manera exploratoria, informaci&oacute;n que refiera al concepto, la din&aacute;mica y sentidos de la propuesta de servicios del hospedaje eco-sustentable. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Desarrollo de propuestas de piezas de comunicaci&oacute;n y m&aacute;rketing digital en lengua portuguesa destinadas al uso en el interior del establecimiento y en las diferentes plataformas digitales (redes sociales).</span></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Realizar el dise&ntilde;o de una encuesta para canalizar las expectativas del cliente.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Participar de una actividad en el establecimiento, a fin de poder canalizar cuales son los aspectos relevantes de las propuestas de hospedaje eco sustentables.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Proponer contenido en portugues que sea relevante en la propuesta del destino.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Especificar qu&eacute; contenidos de la/s asignatura/s se pondr&aacute;n en juego para el desarrollo de la actividades.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Portugu&eacute;s I </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">UNIDADE 1: EU ME CHAMO...</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">CONTE&Uacute;DOS: No primeiro dia de trabalho no Hotel/ Ag&ecirc;ncia/ Minha apresenta&ccedil;&atilde;o aos turistas.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">&ndash; Apresentar-se / Apresentar algu&eacute;m. &ndash; Dar e pedir informa&ccedil;&otilde;es de car&aacute;ter pessoal, profissional e ocupa&ccedil;&atilde;o dos tempos livres.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Portugu&eacute;s II</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">UNIDADE1: ELE &Eacute; DESSE JEITO</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">CONTE&Uacute;DOS: Tentando encontrar um passageiro numa visita guiada / Num Hotel. (Descri&ccedil;&atilde;o f&iacute;sica) &ndash; Descrever sensa&ccedil;&otilde;es corporais. Descri&ccedil;&atilde;o de um ambiente: Hotel (Tipos de habita&ccedil;&otilde;es: mobili&aacute;rio b&aacute;sico) No local do trabalho: numa ag&ecirc;ncia de turismo. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">&ndash; Caracterizar f&iacute;sica e psicologicamente, &ndash; Perguntar e expressar gostos e prefer&ecirc;ncias, &ndash; Descrever e comparar pessoas, lugares, objetos, etc.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">UNIDADE 2: CURTINDO AS F&Eacute;RIAS</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">CONTE&Uacute;DOS: Tempo livre: as viagens. As f&eacute;rias. Atividades de lazer. Diferentes meios de transportes. Na recep&ccedil;&atilde;o de um hotel.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">&ndash; Caracterizar tipos de hot&eacute;is e Servi&ccedil;os oferecidos. &ndash; Perguntar e expressar gostos e prefer&ecirc;ncias. &ndash; Dar e pedir informa&ccedil;&atilde;o sobre transporte e hospedagem.&atilde;w/</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">UNIDADE 3: VAMOS L&Aacute;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">CONTE&Uacute;DOS: pontos cardinais-express&otilde;es idiom&aacute;ticas (o jeito) &ndash;Pedir e dar indica&ccedil;&otilde;es. Fazer recomenda&ccedil;&otilde;es- Previs&atilde;o do tempo. Rua, rodovi&aacute;ria (vocabul&aacute;rio referido a espa&ccedil;os), endere&ccedil;o- Profiss&atilde;o: Guia de turismo-Classifica&ccedil;&atilde;o do guia de turismo- Remunera&ccedil;&atilde;o do guia de turismo.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">L&Eacute;XICO: Localiza&ccedil;&atilde;o no espa&ccedil;o (express&otilde;es: em, dentro de, embaixo de, em frente de, ao lado de, fora de, em cima de, atr&aacute;s de). Frases interrogativas, afirmativas e negativas. Caminhando pela cidade: solicitar localiza&ccedil;&atilde;o &ndash; Pedir e dar indica&ccedil;&otilde;es&ndash;,</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Portugu&eacute;s III</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Unidade 3: Grandes ou pequenas cidades... o que voc&ecirc; prefere?</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">CONTE&Uacute;DOS: caracter&iacute;sticas de diferentes cidades como destinos tur&iacute;sticos,</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">recursos naturais, culturais, descri&ccedil;&atilde;o de seus atrativos. Os bairros. Resolver problemas e situa&ccedil;&otilde;es de conflito com turistas durante um roteiro tur&iacute;stico. Vantagens e desvantagens das grandes cidades. Dar e pedir informa&ccedil;&otilde;es na cidade.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Portugu&eacute;s IV</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Unidade 2: Pesquisando cidades</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">CONTE&Uacute;DOS: caracter&iacute;sticas de diferentes cidades como destinos tur&iacute;sticos, recursos naturais, culturais, descri&ccedil;&atilde;o de seus atrativos. Os bairros. Resolver problemas e situa&ccedil;&otilde;es de conflito com turistas durante um roteiro tur&iacute;stico. Vantagens e desvantagens das grandes cidades. Dar e pedir informa&ccedil;&otilde;es na cidade.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Portugu&eacute;s Anual</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Unidade 1:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">CONTE&Uacute;DOS: No primeiro dia de trabalho no Hotel/ Ag&ecirc;ncia/ Minha apresenta&ccedil;&atilde;o aos turistas.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">&ndash; Apresentar-se / Apresentar algu&eacute;m. &ndash; Dar e pedir informa&ccedil;&otilde;es de car&aacute;ter pessoal, profissional e ocupa&ccedil;&atilde;o dos tempos livres.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Unidade 2:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">CONTE&Uacute;DOS: Tentando encontrar um passageiro (Descri&ccedil;&atilde;o f&iacute;sica) /Meios de hospedagens: Num Hotel - Descri&ccedil;&atilde;o de um ambiente: Hotel (Tipos de habita&ccedil;&otilde;es)-No local do trabalho: numa ag&ecirc;ncia de turismo. A rotina: atividades do cotidiano (trabalho, esporte, atividades de lazer, outras). Como &eacute; o meu dia a dia: narra&ccedil;&atilde;o (oral/escrita) de uma hist&oacute;ria curta.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">&ndash; Caracterizar f&iacute;sica e psicologicamente. &ndash; Perguntar e expressar gostos e prefer&ecirc;ncias &ndash; Falar do dia-a-dia.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Unidade 4:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">CONTE&Uacute;DOS: Tempo livre: as viagens. Op&ccedil;&otilde;es de viagens. As f&eacute;rias. Tipos de turismo e os diferentes meios de transportes. Meios de hospedagens.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">&ndash; Caracterizar os meios de hospedagens e Servi&ccedil;os oferecidos. &ndash; Perguntar e expressar gostos e prefer&ecirc;ncias.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">&ndash; Dar e pedir informa&ccedil;&atilde;o sobre transporte e hospedagem. &ndash;Pagando as contas: moedas e formas de pagamento. Express&otilde;es de pagamento. &ndash;O clima e a geografia nas hospedagens. &ndash;Ecoturismo</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Unidade 6:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">CONTE&Uacute;DOS: Andando pela cidade / povoado- Ruas e avenidas- Rodovi&aacute;rias e pra&ccedil;as-Solicitar localiza&ccedil;&atilde;o- Locais comerciais: lojas, sorveteria, lanchonete, supermercados, sapatarias. Casa de c&acirc;mbio/Posto de gasolina- Atividades e Lugares de lazer: o cinema- o teatro- o museu.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Calidad de los servicios y atenci&oacute;n al cliente.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Atencion al cliente</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Necesidades y expectativas de los clientes.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Calidad como factor diferenciador en el servicio.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Encuestas de satisfacci&oacute;n. Tendencias.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt; mso-border-shadow: yes; margin: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt -.25pt;\"><!-- [if gte mso 9]><xml>\r\n <o:DocumentProperties>\r\n  <o:Version>15.00</o:Version>\r\n </o:DocumentProperties>\r\n <o:OfficeDocumentSettings>\r\n  <o:RelyOnVML/>\r\n  <o:AllowPNG/>\r\n </o:OfficeDocumentSettings>\r\n</xml><![endif]--><!-- [if gte mso 9]><xml>\r\n <w:WordDocument>\r\n  <w:View>Normal</w:View>\r\n  <w:Zoom>0</w:Zoom>\r\n  <w:TrackMoves/>\r\n  <w:TrackFormatting/>\r\n  <w:HyphenationZone>21</w:HyphenationZone>\r\n  <w:PunctuationKerning/>\r\n  <w:ValidateAgainstSchemas/>\r\n  <w:SaveIfXMLInvalid>false</w:SaveIfXMLInvalid>\r\n  <w:IgnoreMixedContent>false</w:IgnoreMixedContent>\r\n  <w:AlwaysShowPlaceholderText>false</w:AlwaysShowPlaceholderText>\r\n  <w:DoNotPromoteQF/>\r\n  <w:LidThemeOther>ES-AR</w:LidThemeOther>\r\n  <w:LidThemeAsian>X-NONE</w:LidThemeAsian>\r\n  <w:LidThemeComplexScript>X-NONE</w:LidThemeComplexScript>\r\n  <w:Compatibility>\r\n   <w:BreakWrappedTables/>\r\n   <w:SnapToGridInCell/>\r\n   <w:WrapTextWithPunct/>\r\n   <w:UseAsianBre