an lang=\"ES-CL\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Cambria; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Identificar conductas obesog&eacute;nicas relacionadas con el estilo de vida, alimentaci&oacute;n y actividad f&iacute;sica.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 15.7pt;\"><span lang=\"ES-CL\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2-</span></span></span><span lang=\"ES-CL\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Cambria; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Promover la formaci&oacute;n de h&aacute;bitos alimentarios saludables.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 15.7pt;\"><span lang=\"ES-CL\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3-</span></span></span><span lang=\"ES-CL\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Cambria; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Identificar conductas cronodisruptivas en la vida diaria.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 15.7pt;\"><span lang=\"ES-CL\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-fa