ite-space: pre-wrap;\">Registros audio</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1pt; border-color: #000000; vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Mayo 2023</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1pt; border-color: #000000; vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">En territorio Casa Lonko Moyeta en Villa Mercedes (SL).&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1pt; border-color: #000000; vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Registro de Memorias de la Masacre del Pozo del Cuadril.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1pt; border-color: #000000; vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Junio 2023</span></p>\r\n</t