0633%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', serif;\">&nbsp;Hospital Pedi&aacute;trico San Luis. Destinatarios:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -14.15pt; line-height: normal; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm -14.15pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Ni&ntilde;os, Ni&ntilde;as y Adolescentes en internaci&oacute;n</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; height: .05pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-right-width: 1pt; border-bottom-width: 1pt; border-left-width: 1pt; border-right-color: black; border-bottom-color: black; border-left-color: black; border-image: initial; border-top: none; background: white; padding: 0.75pt 5.4pt; height: 0.05pt; width: 38.5492%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', serif;\">Acciones de prevenci&oacute;n de enfermedades y promoci&oacute;n de la salud. Difusi&oacute;n de informaci&oacute;n a trav&eacute;s de panfletos, videos, afiches, redes sociales,&nbsp; etc.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom-width: 1pt; border-bottom-color: black; border-right-width: 1pt; border-right-color: black; background: white; padding: 0.75pt; height: 0.05pt; width: 28.3681%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', serif;\">Mensual. Se tendr&aacute;n en cuenta las efem&eacute;rides de salud.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom-width: 1pt; border-bottom-color: black; border-right-width: 1pt; border-right-color: black; background: white; padding: 0.75pt; height: 0.05pt; width: 33.0633%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', serif;\">&nbsp;Hospital Pedi&aacute;trico San Luis. Destinatarios:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', serif;\">Personas adultas acompa&ntilde;antes de pacientes pedi&aacute;tricos.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; height: .05pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-right-width: 1pt; border-bottom-width: 1pt; border-left-width: 1pt; border-right-color: black; border-bottom-color: black; border-left-color: black; border-image: initial; border-top: none; background: white; padding: 0.75pt 5.4pt; height: 0.05pt; width: 38.5492%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', serif;\">Ciclo de Ateneos de formaci&oacute;n sobre aspectos de relevancia que desde la pedagog&iacute;a hospitalaria abonan el trabajo diario y el abordaje de los ni&ntilde;os-pacientes.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom-width: 1pt; border-bottom-color: black; border-right-width: 1pt; border-right-color: black; background: white; padding: 0.75pt; height: 0.05pt; width: 28.3681%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', serif;\">Bimestral durante 2023</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom-width: 1pt; border-bottom-color: black; border-right-width: 1pt; border-right-color: black; background: white; padding: 0.75pt; height: 0.05pt; width: 33.0633%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', serif;\">Aulas del IV Bloque,, FCH.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', serif;\">Destinatarios:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', serif;\">M&eacute;dicos/as Pediatras.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', serif;\">Profesionales del Equipo de Salud (Enfermeros/as Pedi&aacute;tricos/as, Psic&oacute;logas, Asistentes Sociales, Nutricionistas, etc.)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', serif;\">Profesionales de la Educaci&oacute;n interesados en la tem&aacute;tica.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', serif;\">Miembros del Equipo Extensionista.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', serif;\">Estudiantes de carreras de educaci&oacute;n y/o salud.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; height: .05pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-right-width: 1pt; border-bottom-width: 1pt; border-left-width: 1pt; border-right-color: black; border-bottom-color: black; border-left-color: black; border-image: initial; border-top: none; background: white; padding: 0.75pt 5.4pt; height: 0.05pt; width: 38.5492%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', serif;\">Detecci&oacute;n de personas j&oacute;venes y adultas con escolarizaci&oacute;n incompl